  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projects for Tax and Customs management Consolidation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyectos par la Consolidacin de la Gestin Tributaria y Aduanera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del proyecto es incrementar la presin tributaria del gobierno general, buscando utilizar esta mayor recaudacin para aumentar el alcance de los programas sociales y reducir la pobreza, en un marco de equilibrio fiscal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objetive of the project is to increase tax recolection in the General Goverment, seeking to use this major revenue to reach the impact in social programs and poverty reduction, in the balance fiscal framework.</narrative>
  </description>
